+| C6 | 52–57 | `concrete-increasing` | Exact submitted program on `["a","bb","ccc"]` returns `"ccc"`. |
+| C7 | 59–64 | `concrete-late-tie` | Exact submitted program on `["aa","b","cc"]` returns `"aa"`. |
